    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Books Upon Books</strong></h2>A casual, simulation game in which you get to design, build upon, and upgrade your very own bookshop, before tending to it's customers during the day!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building</h2>Spend your hard-earned money on buying up to 3 objects per day, unlocking new tiles and rearranging your shop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colour Palette</h2>Customise every detail of your shop, even down to the colours used. With 8 changeable colours used throughout, alter these to fit your style and make the shop your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999740/extras/e05f11df3b51e7eb90d64397c1495001.avif?t=1743849068\" width=620 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers</h2>Customers will come in throughout the day, rummaging through the shelves before going to the counter to be served by you or your temporary hired staff, giving a number of coins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999740/extras/15b9f23c093a37c098ff2ca075d53125.avif?t=1743849068\" width=620 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restock Shelves</h2>Once the customer has taken a book, the shelf will need to be restocked. You can see taken books by the red outline.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Books Upon Books</strong></h2>A casual, simulation game in which you get to design, build upon, and upgrade your very own bookshop, before tending to it's customers during the day!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building</h2>Spend your hard-earned money on buying up to 3 objects per day, unlocking new tiles and rearranging your shop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colour Palette</h2>Customise every detail of your shop, even down to the colours used. With 8 changeable colours used throughout, alter these to fit your style and make the shop your own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999740/extras/e05f11df3b51e7eb90d64397c1495001.avif?t=1743849068\" width=620 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers</h2>Customers will come in throughout the day, rummaging through the shelves before going to the counter to be served by you or your temporary hired staff, giving a number of coins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999740/extras/15b9f23c093a37c098ff2ca075d53125.avif?t=1743849068\" width=620 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restock Shelves</h2>Once the customer has taken a book, the shelf will need to be restocked. You can see taken books by the red outline.",
